    "Text values (ASCII) have character n in the low byte and character n+1 in the high byte of each word.",
    "Not in this map: the event tables, the settings and disturbance recording zones (indirect access), the bit-by-bit definitions of the status words, the remote control orders and the 16-bit compatibility zones kept for Sepam 2000."
